{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0e Guide a young bird on his quest to find the Chalice of Highland \u2694\ufe0e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Chalice of Highland, embark on an epic adventure inspired by Gameboy aesthetics. Explore the world and dive into six challenging dungeons to recover the Chalice of Highland. As a brave bird, you\u2019ll wield a sword to battle enemies and use your unique ability to fly, uncovering secrets along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    6 Unique Dungeons: Each dungeon presents its own mechanics and challenges, keeping the gameplay fresh and exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    7 Epic Bosses: Face off against formidable bosses guarding each piece of the Chalice of Highland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    7 Dream Sequences: Uncover the hero's backstory through dream sequences that reveal the mysterious past of the Highlands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Customizable Screen Colors: Choose from different screen color palettes to enhance your retro gaming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Classic or Widescreen: Play in the original Gameboy format or switch to a 16:9 widescreen view for a modern twist.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"And that's one !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3281550/b37c60ef733daeb4d1a7166065a481e642a92e67.jpg"},{"name":"Without the float !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3281550/b37c60ef733daeb4d1a7166065a481e642a92e67.jpg"},{"name":"Can I eat it ?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3281550/b37c60ef733daeb4d1a7166065a481e642a92e67.jpg"},{"name":"FINALLY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3281550/c1f0d679eb4efa2db99b5b43ecfaf8d257